# Jacob, 2026-09-01, absolute: "get kids off the damn screen ... under no circumstance."
# Uncertain is a REFUSAL. These 233 demos each serve at least one HARVESTED
# photograph and NOBODY HAS EVER OPENED A SINGLE FRAME on any of them. Five demos taken down
